''Testing `$funcGainLink`''
<br>
$cssDesc[Create a link, only for gains with no dice rolls. Losses/expenditures and dice rolls are handled by `$funcCheckGate`.<br>Sample use: `($funcGainLink: "Link Text", "restless", 1, "test.B.gained")`. To move time forward, input "code.timePass" in the 5th (last) parameter.]

<ol>
<li>($funcGainLink: "Gain 1 Restlessness", "restless", 1, [], "test.B.gained")</li>
<li>($funcGainLink: "Gain 1 Restlessness, but time moves forward", "restless", 1, [], "code.timePass")</li>
</ol>


